<div class=\"hole\"></div>\n            <div class=\"hole\"></div>\n            <div class=\"hole\"></div>\n            <div class=\"hole\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"notepad-content\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder deco-star-1\">[Illustration:<br>Yellow Star]</div>\n            <div class=\"placeholder deco-star-2\">[Illustration:<br>Yellow Star]</div>\n            <div class=\"placeholder deco-star-3\">[Illustration:<br>Yellow Star]</div>\n            <div class=\"placeholder deco-flower\">[Illustration:<br>Red Flower]</div>\n\n            <div class=\"title\">4.语法</div>\n            \n            <div class=\"text-body\">\n                <div class=\"paragraph\">\n                    语法是语言的框架。光知道单词却不懂<br>\n                    语法，你就无法完整地说出一个句子，<br>\n                    有时候还可能让人产生误解；单词都认<br>\n                    识，但是凑在一起就不知道句子是什么<br>\n                    意思，也会感到尴尬。\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"paragraph\">\n                    虽然提起学语法，大家都是感觉头都<br>\n                    大，各种时态错综复杂怎么记？但是任<br>\n                    何一门学科都是由浅入深的，英语也不<br>\n                    例外。\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"paragraph\">\n                    学习语法就像造房子，首先要把基础的<br>\n                    语法脉络理清，打好根基，之后再慢慢<br>\n                    补充和拓展，让知识巩固起来。\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"paragraph\">\n                    零基础的同学在学习英语语法时可以先<br>\n                    从简单的开始。比如五大基本句型和八<br>\n                    大时态等。\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
